#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The algorithm ensures that you always have a grid, that there are enough but not too many grid lines, and that the grid is metric. This parameter will also ensure that you get enough decimals displayed even if your graph goes from 69.998 to 70.001.<br><strong>Note: </strong>This parameter may interfere with --alt-autoscale options."
msgstr "I-algorithm iqinisekisa ukuthi uhlala unegridi, ukuthi kunemigqa yegridi eyanele kodwa engeminingi kakhulu, nokuthi igridi ingeyemethrikhi. Le pharamitha izophinde iqinisekise ukuthi uthola amadesimali anele aboniswayo noma ngabe igrafu yakho isuka ku-69.998 iye ku-70.001.<br><strong>Qaphela: </strong>Le pharamitha ingaphazamisa izinketho ze--alt-autoscale."

