#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The name that is printed on the graph.  It can include replacement variables such as |host_description| or |query_fieldName|.  For a complete list of supported replacement tags, please see the Kadupul documentation."
msgstr "Igama eliphrintwa egrafini.  Lingafaka iziguquguquki zokufaka esikhundleni ezifana no-|host_description| noma |query_fieldName|.  Ukuze uthole uhlu oluphelele lwamathegi okufaka esikhundleni asekelwayo, sicela ubheke amadokhumenti e-Kadupul."

