#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The timeout value to use for host ICMP and UDP pinging.  This host SNMP timeout value applies for SNMP pings."
msgstr "Inani lokuphela kwesikhathi elizosetshenziselwa i-ping ye-ICMP ne-UDP yehosti.  Leli nani lokuphela kwesikhathi se-SNMP yehosti lisebenza kuma-ping e-SNMP."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The type of graph that is generated; PNG, GIF or SVG.  The selection of graph image type is very RRDtool dependent."
msgstr "Uhlobo lwegrafu olukhiqizwayo; PNG, GIF noma SVG.  Ukukhethwa kohlobo lwesithombe segrafu kuncike kakhulu ku-RRDtool."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "The type of ping packet to sent.  <br><i>NOTE: ICMP on Linux/UNIX requires root privileges.</i>  <br><i>NOTE: TCP Ping Closed - Even if the tcp ping is not successful, the device can be considered UP.</i>"
msgstr "Uhlobo lwephakethe le-ping elizothunyelwa.  <br><i>QAPHELA: I-ICMP ku-Linux/UNIX idinga amalungelo e-root.</i>  <br><i>QAPHELA: I-TCP Ping Ivaliwe - Ngisho noma i-tcp ping ingaphumeleli, idivayisi ingathathwa njengePHEZULU.</i>"

