msgid "The width (in pixels) of the graph area within the graph. This area does not include the legend, axis legends, or title."
msgstr "Ububanzi (ngamaphikseli) bendawo yegrafu ngaphakathi kwegrafu. Le ndawo ayihlanganisi ilejendi, amalejendi e-eksisi, noma isihloko."

