msgstr "Sebenzisa i--alt-autoscale-min (ukwamukela umkhawulo ophezulu)"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use <br> --alt-autoscale to scale to the absolute minimum and maximum <br> --alt-autoscale-max to scale to the maximum value, using a given lower limit <br> --alt-autoscale-min to scale to the minimum value, using a given upper limit <br> --alt-autoscale (with limits) to scale using both lower and upper limits (RRDtool default) <br>"
msgstr "Sebenzisa i-<br> --alt-autoscale ukulinganisa ubuncane obuphelele nobukhulu <br> --alt-autoscale-max ukulinganisa inani elikhulu, usebenzisa umkhawulo ophansi onikeziwe <br> --alt-autoscale-min ukulinganisa inani elincane, usebenzisa umkhawulo ophezulu onikeziwe <br> --alt-autoscale (enemikhawulo) ukulinganisa usebenzisa kokubili imikhawulo ephansi neyaphezulu (okuzenzakalelayo kwe-RRDtool) <br>"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use Logarithmic y-axis scaling"
msgstr "Sebenzisa ukulinganisa kwe-eksisi ye-y ye-Logarithmic"

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use SI Units for Logarithmic Scaling instead of using exponential notation.<br> Note: Linear graphs use SI notation by default."
msgstr "Sebenzisa Amayunithi e-SI Ekulinganiseni Kwe-Logarithmic esikhundleni sokusebenzisa ukubhala kwe-exponential.<br> Qaphela: Amagrafu aqondile asebenzisa ukubhala kwe-SI ngokuzenzakalelayo."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Use this Option to create e.g. STACKed graphs.<br>AREA/STACK: 1st graph keeps AREA/STACK items, others convert to STACK<br>LINE1: all items convert to LINE1 items<br>LINE2: all items convert to LINE2 items<br>LINE3: all items convert to LINE3 items"
msgstr "Sebenzisa le Nketho ukudala isib. amagrafu e-STACKed.<br>AREA/STACK: Igrafu yokuqala igcina izinto ze-AREA/STACK, ezinye ziguqukela ku-STACK<br>LINE1: zonke izinto ziguqukela ezintweni ze-LINE1<br>LINE2: zonke izinto ziguqukela ezintweni ze-LINE2<br>LINE3: zonke izinto ziguqukela ezintweni ze-LINE3"

