msgstr "Yiyiphi iyunithi i-Kadupul okufanele iyisebenzise ku-eksisi ye-Y. Sebenzisa u-3 ukubonisa yonke into ngo-\"k\" noma u--6 ukubonisa yonke into ngo-\"u\" (micro)."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When data is gathered, the data for this field will be put into this data source."
msgstr "Lapho idatha iqoqwa, idatha yale nkambu izofakwa kulo mthombo wedatha."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When enabled, the selected Auto Scale Option determines which limits RRDtool uses: --alt-autoscale ignores both limits, --alt-autoscale-max keeps the lower limit, --alt-autoscale-min keeps the upper limit, and --alt-autoscale (accepting both limits) keeps both limits. When disabled, the configured lower and upper limits are used directly. Rigid Boundaries controls whether values outside those limits expand the graph range."
msgstr "Uma kunikwe amandla, Inketho Yokuzenzakalela Kokukala ekhethiwe inquma ukuthi yimiphi imikhawulo esetshenziswa yi-RRDtool: i--alt-autoscale iziba yomibili imikhawulo, i--alt-autoscale-max igcina umkhawulo ophansi, i--alt-autoscale-min igcina umkhawulo ophezulu, futhi i--alt-autoscale (ukwamukela yomibili imikhawulo) igcina yomibili imikhawulo. Uma kukhutshaziwe, imikhawulo ephansi neyaphezulu elungiselelwe isetshenziswa ngokuqondile. Imingcele Eqinile ilawula ukuthi amanani angaphandle kwaleyo mikhawulo anweba ububanzi begrafu yini."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When viewing a Graph based upon the RRA in question, the default Timespan to show for that Graph."
msgstr "Lapho ubuka Igrafu esekelwe ku-RRA okukhulunywa ngayo, Ubude Besikhathi obuzenzakalelayo bokubonisa leyo Grafu."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you setup the left axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Lapho usetha ukulebula kwe-eksisi engakwesokunxele, sebenzisa umthetho kufomethi yedatha.  Amafomethi asekelwayo afaka i-\"numeric\" lapho idatha iphathwa njengezinombolo, i-\"timestamp\" lapho amanani ehunyushwa njengezitembu zesikhathi ze-UNIX (inani lemizuzwana kusukela ngoJanuwari 1970) futhi aveze kusetshenziswa ifomethi ye-strftime (okuzenzakalelayo ngu-\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  Bheka futhi --units-length.  Ekugcineni \"duration\" lapho amanani ehunyushwa njengobude besikhathi ngama-millisecond.  Ukufometha kulandela imithetho ye-PRINT/GPRINT efanelekayo ye-valstrfduration."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "When you setup the right axis labeling, apply a rule to the data format.  Supported formats include \"numeric\" where data is treated as numeric, \"timestamp\" where values are interpreted as UNIX timestamps (number of seconds since January 1970) and expressed using strftime format (default is \"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  See also --units-length and --right-axis-format.  Finally \"duration\" where values are interpreted as duration in milliseconds.  Formatting follows the rules of valstrfduration qualified PRINT/GPRINT."
msgstr "Lapho usetha ukulebula kwe-eksisi engakwesokudla, sebenzisa umthetho kufomethi yedatha.  Amafomethi asekelwayo afaka i-\"numeric\" lapho idatha iphathwa njengezinombolo, i-\"timestamp\" lapho amanani ehunyushwa njengezitembu zesikhathi ze-UNIX (inani lemizuzwana kusukela ngoJanuwari 1970) futhi aveze kusetshenziswa ifomethi ye-strftime (okuzenzakalelayo ngu-\"%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S\").  Bheka futhi --units-length ne--right-axis-format.  Ekugcineni \"duration\" lapho amanani ehunyushwa njengobude besikhathi ngama-millisecond.  Ukufometha kulandela imithetho ye-PRINT/GPRINT efanelekayo ye-valstrfduration."

#: include/global_form.php
msgid "Whether Kadupul should gather data for this data source or not."
msgstr "Ukuthi i-Kadupul kufanele iqoqe idatha yalo mthombo wedatha noma cha."

#: include/global_form.php
