#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "<blockquote><i>Built-in Authentication</i> - Kadupul handles user authentication, which allows you to create users and give them rights to different areas within Kadupul.<br><br><i>Web Basic Authentication</i> - Authentication is handled by the web server. Users can be added or created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.<br><br><i>LDAP Authentication</i> - Allows for authentication against a LDAP server. Users will be created automatically on first login if the Template User is defined, otherwise the defined guest permissions will be used.  If PHPs LDAP module is not enabled, LDAP Authentication will not appear as a selectable option.<br><br><i>Multiple LDAP/AD Domain Authentication</i> - Allows administrators to support multiple disparate groups from different LDAP/AD directories to access Kadupul resources.  Just as LDAP Authentication, the PHP LDAP module is required to utilize this method.</blockquote>"
msgstr "<blockquote><i>Ukuqinisekisa Okwakhelwe Ngaphakathi</i> - I-Kadupul iphatha ukuqinisekiswa kwabasebenzisi, okukuvumela ukuthi udale abasebenzisi futhi ubanike amalungelo ezindaweni ezahlukene ngaphakathi kwe-Kadupul.<br><br><i>Ukuqinisekisa Okuyisisekelo Kwewebhu</i> - Ukuqinisekisa kuphathwa yiseva yewebhu. Abasebenzisi bangangezwa noma badalwe ngokuzenzakalelayo lapho bengena okokuqala uma Umsebenzisi Wesifanekiso echaziwe, kungenjalo kuzosetshenziswa izimvume zezivakashi ezichaziwe.<br><br><i>Ukuqinisekisa kwe-LDAP</i> - Kuvumela ukuqinisekiswa kwiseva ye-LDAP. Abasebenzisi bazodalwa ngokuzenzakalelayo lapho bengena okokuqala uma Umsebenzisi Wesifanekiso echaziwe, kungenjalo kuzosetshenziswa izimvume zezivakashi ezichaziwe. Uma imojuli ye-LDAP ye-PHP inganikiwe amandla, Ukuqinisekisa kwe-LDAP ngeke kuvele njengenketho engakhethwa.<br><br><i>Ukuqinisekisa Kwezizinda Eziningi ze-LDAP/AD</i> - Kuvumela abalawuli ukuthi basekele amaqembu amaningi ahlukene asuka ezinhleni zemibhalo ezahlukene ze-LDAP/AD ukuze afinyelele izinsiza ze-Kadupul. Njengokuqinisekisa kwe-LDAP, imojuli ye-PHP LDAP iyadingeka ukuze kusetshenziswe le ndlela.</blockquote>"

#: include/global_settings.php
