msgstr "Uhlu oluhlukaniswe ngokhefana lwama-ID Amadivayisi ofisa ukuthi abe kumodi ye-Debug ngesikhathi sokuqoqwa kwedatha. Leli zinga le-Debug lisebenza kuphela ngesikhathi senqubo yokuqoqa ye-Kadupul."

