#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "By default, the main Kadupul Data Collector will cache the entire web site and plugins into a Resource Cache.  Then, periodically the Remote Data Collectors will update themselves with any updates from the main Kadupul Data Collector.  This Resource Cache essentially allows Remote Data Collectors to self upgrade.  If you do not wish to use this option, you can disable it using this setting."
msgstr "Ngokuzenzakalelayo, uMqoqi Wedatha oyinhloko we-Kadupul uzogcina yonke iwebhusayithi nama-plugin ku-Resource Cache. Bese, ngezikhathi ezithile Abaqoqi Bedatha Abakude bazozibuyekeza nganoma yiziphi izibuyekezo ezivela kuMqoqi Wedatha oyinhloko we-Kadupul. Le Resource Cache ivumela Abaqoqi Bedatha Abakude ukuthi bazithuthukise ngokwabo. Uma ungafuni ukusebenzisa le nketho, ungayikhubaza usebenzisa lesi silungiselelo."

