#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How often do you want the Kadupul log display to update."
msgstr "Ufuna ukuthi isibonisi selogi se-Kadupul sibuyekezwe kangaki."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How should Kadupul support Client Dates based upon the Client browsers timezone."
msgstr "I-Kadupul kufanele isekele kanjani Izinsuku Zeklayenti ngokusekelwe endaweni yesikhathi yesiphequluli seKlayenti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How will Kadupul handle event logging."
msgstr "I-Kadupul izokuphatha kanjani ukugcinwa kwelogi yezehlakalo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How would you like Kadupul to present dates?  This setting will also change the way that Kadupul Graphs dates are represented."
msgstr "Ungathanda ukuthi i-Kadupul ibonise kanjani izinsuku? Lesi silungiselelo sizophinde sishintshe indlela izinsuku ze-Kadupul Graphs ezimelwa ngayo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How would you like the Data Collector output errors logged?  Options include: 'Detailed' which details every error, 'Summary' which provides the number of output errors per Device, and 'None', which does not provide error counts."
msgstr "Ungathanda ukuthi amaphutha okukhipha oMqoqi Wedatha alogwe kanjani? Izinketho zifaka: i-'Detailed' echaza iphutha ngalinye, i-'Summary' enikeza inani lamaphutha okukhipha ngeDivayisi ngayinye, kanye ne-'None', enganikezi izibalo zamaphutha."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If Checked Kadupul will log extra LDAP information to the Kadupul log during Binding and Searching activities."
msgstr "Uma Kumakiwe i-Kadupul izologa ulwazi olwengeziwe lwe-LDAP kulogi ye-Kadupul ngesikhathi semisebenzi ye-Binding ne-Searching."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If Kadupul can not determine the interface speed due to either ifSpeed or ifHighSpeed not being set or being zero, what maximum value do you wish on the resulting RRDfiles."
msgstr "Uma i-Kadupul ingakwazi ukunquma isivinini se-interface ngenxa yokuthi i-ifSpeed noma i-ifHighSpeed ayisethiwe noma ingu-zero, yiliphi inani elikhulu olifisayo kumafayela e-RRD avelayo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If a Device Data Source is included in an Aggregate Graph, show that Graph along with other Device Graphs"
msgstr "Uma Umthombo Wedatha Wedivayisi ufakiwe ku-Aggregate Graph, bonisa leyo Grafu kanye namanye Amagrafu Edivayisi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If a user authenticates and selects 'Keep me signed in', an authentication cookie will be created on the user's computer allowing that user to stay logged in.  The authentication cookie expires after 90 days of non-use."
msgstr "Uma umsebenzisi eqinisekisa bese ekhetha u-'Keep me signed in', kuzokwakhiwa i-authentication cookie kukhompyutha yomsebenzisi evumela lowo msebenzisi ukuthi ahlale engenile. I-authentication cookie iphelelwa yisikhathi ngemva kwezinsuku ezingu-90 ingasetshenziswa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If both main and backup proxy are receivable this option allows to spread all requests against RRDtool."
msgstr "Uma kokubili i-proxy eyinhloko neyokusekelayo kutholakala le nketho ivumela ukusabalalisa zonke izicelo eziya ku-RRDtool."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If enabled, Kadupul will remember your Tree History between logins and when you return to the Graphs page."
msgstr "Uma kunikwe amandla, i-Kadupul izokhumbula Umlando Wakho Wesihlahla phakathi kokungena ngemvume nalapho ubuyela ekhasini Lamagrafu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If set to Simple, Graphs and Data Sources can only be created from New Graphs.  If Advanced, legacy Graph and Data Source creation is supported."
msgstr "Uma kusethwe ku-Simple, Amagrafu Nemithombo Yedatha kungakhiwa kuphela kusuka ku-New Graphs. Uma kuyi-Advanced, ukwakhiwa kwama-Graph ne-Data Source okudala kuyasekelwa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost output table exceeds this size, in records, an update will take place."
