msgstr "Ukuphela Kwesikhathi Se-Bind ngemizuzwana."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The DNS hostname or IP address of the RRDtool backup proxy server if proxy is running in MSR mode."
msgstr "Igama lehosti le-DNS noma ikheli le-IP leseva ye-proxy yokusekela ye-RRDtool uma i-proxy isebenza kumodi ye-MSR."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The DNS hostname or IP address of the RRDtool proxy server."
msgstr "Igama lehosti le-DNS noma ikheli le-IP leseva ye-proxy ye-RRDtool."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Default Threads allowed per process.  NOTE: Starting in Kadupul 1.2+, this setting is maintained in the Data Collector, and this is simply the Preset.  Using a higher number when using Spine will improve performance.  However, ensure that you have enough MySQL/MariaDB connections to support the following equation: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers).  You must also ensure that you have enough spare connections for user login connections as well."
msgstr "Imicu Ezenzakalelayo evunyelwe ngenqubo ngayinye.  QAPHELA: Kusukela ku-Kadupul 1.2+, lesi silungiselelo sigcinwa kuMqoqi Wedatha, futhi lokhu kumane Kuyisilungiselelo Esisethwe Kuqala.  Ukusebenzisa inombolo enkulu lapho usebenzisa i-Spine kuzothuthukisa ukusebenza.  Nokho, qinisekisa ukuthi unokuxhumana okwanele kwe-MySQL/MariaDB ukusekela leli fomyula elandelayo: connections = data collectors * processes * (threads + script servers).  Kufanele futhi uqinisekise ukuthi unokuxhumana okwanele okusele kokungena kwabasebenzisi futhi."

#: include/global_settings.php
