#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are three replacement methods.  The first method replaces the spike with the average of the data source in question.  The second method replaces the spike with a 'NaN'.  The last replaces the spike with the last known good value found."
msgstr "Kunezindlela ezintathu zokufaka esikhundleni.  Indlela yokuqala ithatha indawo ye-spike ngesilinganiso somthombo wedatha okukhulunywa ngawo.  Indlela yesibili ithatha indawo ye-spike ngo-'NaN'.  Eyokugcina ithatha indawo ye-spike ngenani elihle lokugcina elitholakele."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are two removal methods.  The first, Standard Deviation, will remove any sample that is X number of standard deviations away from the average of samples.  The second method, Variance, will remove any sample that is X% more than the Variance average.  The Variance method takes into account a certain number of 'outliers'.  Those are exceptional samples, like the spike, that need to be excluded from the Variance Average calculation."
msgstr "Kunezindlela ezimbili zokususa.  Eyokuqala, Ukuphambuka Okujwayelekile, izosusa noma yiliphi isampula eliyinani lika-X lokuphambuka okujwayelekile ukude nesilinganiso samasampula.  Indlela yesibili, Ukuhluka, izosusa noma yiliphi isampula elingu-X% ngaphezu kwesilinganiso Sokuhluka.  Indlela Yokuhluka ibheka inani elithile 'lamaphutha ahlukile'.  Lawo ngamasampula ahlukile, njenge-spike, adinga ukukhishwa ekubalweni Kwesilinganiso Sokuhluka."

