msgstr "Siyabonga ngokuthatha isikhathi sakho ukulanda nokufaka i-Kadupul, isixazululo esiphelele sokwenza amagrafu enethiwekhi yakho. Ngaphambi kokuthi uqale ukwenza amagrafu amahle, kukhona ulwazi olumbalwa i-Kadupul edinga ukulwazi."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The Data Source paths could not be read, so RRDfile locations were not checked. Check them after the upgrade with the poller log."
msgstr "Izindlela Zomthombo Wedatha azikwazanga ukufundwa, ngakho izindawo ze-RRDfile azihlolwanga. Zihlole ngemva kokuthuthukisa ngelogi ye-poller."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The Installer automatically assigns a $poller_id and adds it to the config.php file."
msgstr "Isifaki sabela ngokuzenzakalelayo u-$poller_id futhi simengeze kufayela le-config.php."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The Installer could not proceed due to an unexpected error."
msgstr "Isifaki asikwazanga ukuqhubeka ngenxa yephutha elingalindelekile."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The PHP binary location is not valid and must be updated."
msgstr "Indawo yebhinari ye-PHP ayivumelekile futhi kufanele ibuyekezwe."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The following PHP extensions are mandatory, and MUST be installed before continuing your Kadupul install."
msgstr "Izandiso ze-PHP ezilandelayo ziphoqelekile, futhi KUFANELE zifakwe ngaphambi kokuqhubeka nokufaka kwakho i-Kadupul."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The following PHP extensions are recommended, and should be installed before continuing your Kadupul install.  NOTE: If you are planning on supporting SNMPv3 with IPv6, you should not install the php-snmp module at this time."
msgstr "Izandiso ze-PHP ezilandelayo ziyanconywa, futhi kufanele zifakwe ngaphambi kokuqhubeka nokufaka kwakho i-Kadupul.  QAPHELA: Uma uhlela ukusekela i-SNMPv3 nge-IPv6, akufanele ufake imojuli ye-php-snmp ngalesi sikhathi."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The following information has been determined from Kadupul's configuration file. If it is not correct, please edit \"include/config.php\" before continuing."
msgstr "Ulwazi olulandelayo lunqunywe efayeleni lokulungiselela lakwa-Kadupul. Uma lungalungile, sicela uhlele u-\"include/config.php\" ngaphambi kokuqhubeka."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The following tables should be converted to UTF8 and InnoDB with a Dynamic row format.  Please select the tables that you wish to convert during the installation process."
msgstr "Amathebula alandelayo kufanele aguqulelwe ku-UTF8 ne-InnoDB enefomethi yomugqa we-Dynamic.  Sicela ukhethe amathebula ofisa ukuwaguqula ngesikhathi senqubo yokufaka."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The installation cannot continue because no profiles could be found."
msgstr "Ukufaka akukwazi ukuqhubeka ngoba awekho amaphrofayela atholakele."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The installed database could not be checked because its table list could not be read."
msgstr "Isizindalwazi esifakiwe asikwazanga ukuhlolwa ngoba uhlu lwamathebula aso alukwazanga ukufundwa."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The installed database could not be checked because the core table list could not be read from cacti.sql."
msgstr "Isizindalwazi esifakiwe asikwazanga ukuhlolwa ngoba uhlu lwamathebula ayisisekelo alukwazanga ukufundwa ku-cacti.sql."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The installed database version could not be confirmed. Review the installer errors before retrying."
msgstr "Inguqulo yesizindalwazi efakiwe ayikwazanga ukuqinisekiswa. Buyekeza amaphutha esifaki ngaphambi kokuzama futhi."

