msgid "The installer CLI interpreter is unavailable for refreshing the Symfony production cache."
msgstr "Umhumushi we-CLI wesifaki akatholakali ukuze avuselele inqolobane yokukhiqiza ye-Symfony."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The primary CDEF reference contract could not be installed. Review the schema and installer privileges before retrying."
msgstr "Inkontileka yesithenjwa eyinhloko ye-CDEF ayikwazanga ukufakwa. Buyekeza isikimu namalungelo esifaki ngaphambi kokuzama futhi."

