msgid "The way that the Whitelisting works is that when you first import a Data Input Method, or you re-import a Data Input Method, and the script and or arguments change in any way, the Data Input Method, and all the corresponding Data Sources will be immediately disabled until the administrator validates that the Data Input Method is valid."
msgstr "Indlela Uhlu Olugunyaziwe olusebenza ngayo ukuthi lapho uqala ukungenisa Indlela Yokufaka Idatha, noma ungenisa kabusha Indlela Yokufaka Idatha, futhi iskripthi kanye noma ama-argument kushintsha nganoma iyiphi indlela, Indlela Yokufaka Idatha, nayo yonke Imithombo Yedatha ehambisanayo izokhutshazwa ngokushesha kuze kube yilapho umlawuli eqinisekisa ukuthi Indlela Yokufaka Idatha ivumelekile."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Then run the following within MySQL as an administrator:"
msgstr "Bese usebenzisa okulandelayo ngaphakathi kwe-MySQL njengomlawuli:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Therefore, several versions ago, Kadupul was enhanced to provide Whitelist capabilities on the these types of Data Input Methods.  Though this does secure Kadupul more thoroughly, it does increase the amount of work required by the Kadupul administrator to import and manage Templates and Packages."
msgstr "Ngakho-ke, ezinguqulweni ezimbalwa ezedlule, i-Kadupul yathuthukiswa ukuhlinzeka ngamandla Ohlu Olugunyaziwe kulezi zinhlobo Zezindlela Zokufaka Idatha.  Nakuba lokhu kuvikela i-Kadupul ngokucophelela okukhulu, kwandisa umsebenzi odingekayo ngumlawuli wakwa-Kadupul ukungenisa nokuphatha Izifanekiso Namaphakeji."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "These MySQL performance tuning settings will help your Kadupul system perform better without issues for a longer time."
msgstr "Lezi zilungiselelo zokulungisa ukusebenza kwe-MySQL zizosiza isistimu yakho ye-Kadupul ukuthi isebenze kangcono ngaphandle kwezinkinga isikhathi eside."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "These directories will be required to stay read writable after the install so that the Kadupul remote synchronization process can update them as the Main Kadupul Web Site changes"
msgstr "Lezi zinhla zamafolda zizodingeka ukuthi zihlale zifundeka futhi zibhaleka ngemva kokufaka ukuze inqubo yokuvumelanisa okukude yakwa-Kadupul ikwazi ukuzibuyekeza njengoba Iwebhusayithi Enkulu yakwa-Kadupul ishintsha"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This error may also be generated if the cacti database user does not have correct permissions on the Kadupul database. Please ensure that the Kadupul database user has the ability to SELECT, INSERT, DELETE, UPDATE, CREATE, ALTER, DROP, INDEX on the Kadupul database."
msgstr "Leli phutha lingakhiqizwa futhi uma umsebenzisi wesizindalwazi se-cacti engenazo izimvume ezifanele kusizindalwazi se-Kadupul. Sicela uqinisekise ukuthi umsebenzisi wesizindalwazi se-Kadupul unekhono lokuthi SELECT, INSERT, DELETE, UPDATE, CREATE, ALTER, DROP, INDEX kusizindalwazi se-Kadupul."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This may occur if you have a blank database and have not yet imported the cacti.sql file"
msgstr "Lokhu kungenzeka uma unesizindalwazi esingenalutho futhi ungakangenisi ifayela le-cacti.sql"

