#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Updating Templates that you have already made modifications to is not advisable.  The Upgrade of the Templates will NOT remove modifications to Graph and Data Templates, and can lead to unexpected behavior.  However, if you have not made changes to any Graph, Data Query, or Data Template, reimporting the Package should not have any affect.  In that case, you would have to 'Sync Graphs' to from the Templates after update."
msgstr "Ukubuyekeza Izifanekiso osuvele uzenzile izinguquko kuzo akwelulekwa.  Ukuthuthukiswa Kwezifanekiso NGEKE kususe izinguquko Ezifanekisweni Zegrafu Nezedatha, futhi kungaholela ekuziphatheni okungalindelekile.  Nokho, uma ungazange wenze ushintsho kunoma iyiphi Igrafu, Umbuzo Wedatha, noma Isifanekiso Sedatha, ukungenisa kabusha Iphakeji akufanele kube nomthelela.  Kuleso simo, kuyodingeka 'Uvumelanise Amagrafu' kusuka Ezifanekisweni ngemva kokubuyekeza."

#: lib/installer.php
