msgstr "ISEXWAYISO: Isifanekiso Sedivayisi Sesistimu Yakho Yokusebenza Asitholakalanga.  Uzodinga ukungenisa Izifanekiso Zedivayisi noma Amaphakeji e-Kadupul ukuze uqaphe iseva yakho ye-Kadupul."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Web"
