msgstr "Iseva Yakho ye-Kadupul v%s ifakiwe/ibuyekeziwe.  Manje ungaqala ukusebenzisa isofthiwe."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Kadupul configuration has the relative correct path (url_path) in config.php."
msgstr "Ukulungiselelwa kwakho kwe-Kadupul kunendlela eyisihlobo efanele (url_path) ku-config.php."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Kadupul database account has access to the MySQL TimeZone database and that database is populated with global TimeZone information."
msgstr "I-akhawunti yakho yesizindalwazi se-Kadupul inokufinyelela kusizindalwazi se-MySQL TimeZone futhi leso sizindalwazi sigcwele ngolwazi lwe-TimeZone yomhlaba wonke."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Kadupul database login account does not have access to the MySQL TimeZone database.  Please provide the Kadupul database account \"select\" access to the \"time_zone_name\" table in the \"mysql\" database, and populate MySQL's TimeZone information before proceeding."
msgstr "I-akhawunti yakho yokungena yesizindalwazi se-Kadupul ayinakho ukufinyelela kusizindalwazi se-MySQL TimeZone.  Sicela unikeze i-akhawunti yesizindalwazi se-Kadupul ukufinyelela kwe-\"select\" kuthebula le-\"time_zone_name\" kusizindalwazi se-\"mysql\", futhi ugcwalise ulwazi lwe-TimeZone ye-MySQL ngaphambi kokuqhubeka."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your MySQL TimeZone database is not populated.  Please populate this database before proceeding."
msgstr "Isizindalwazi sakho se-MySQL TimeZone asigcwalisiwe.  Sicela ugcwalise lesi sizindalwazi ngaphambi kokuqhubeka."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your Remote Kadupul Poller information has not been included in your config.php file.  Please review the config.php.dist, and set the variables: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, etc.  These variables must be set and point back to your Primary Kadupul database server.  Correct this and try again."
msgstr "Ulwazi lwakho lwe-Remote Kadupul Poller alufakiwe kufayela lakho le-config.php.  Sicela ubuyekeze i-config.php.dist, bese usetha iziguquguquki: <i>$rdatabase_default, $rdatabase_username</i>, njll.  Lezi ziguquguquki kufanele zisethwe futhi zikhombe emuva kuseva yakho yesizindalwazi Eyinhloko ye-Kadupul.  Lungisa lokhu bese uzama futhi."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your config.php file must be writable by the web server during install in order to configure the Remote poller.  Once installation is complete, you must set this file to Read Only to prevent possible security issues."
msgstr "Ifayela lakho le-config.php kufanele libhaleke yiseva yewebhu ngesikhathi sokufaka ukuze kulungiselelwe i-poller Ekude.  Uma ukufaka sekuqediwe, kufanele usethe leli fayela ukuthi Lifundwe Kuphela ukuze uvimbele izinkinga zokuvikeleka ezingenzeka."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Your database default collation appears to be UTF8 compliant"
msgstr "Ukuhlanganiswa okuzenzakalelayo kwesizindalwazi sakho kubonakala kuhambisana ne-UTF8"

