#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s will divide the innodb_buffer_pool into memory regions to improve performance for versions of MariaDB less than 10.5.  The max value is 64, but should not exceed more than the number of CPU cores/threads.  When your innodb_buffer_pool is less than 1GB, you should use the pool size divided by 128MB.  Continue to use this equation up to the max the number of CPU cores or 64."
msgstr "I-%s izohlukanisa i-innodb_buffer_pool ibe izigaba zenkumbulo ukuze ithuthukise ukusebenza ezinguqulweni ze-MariaDB ezingaphansi kwe-10.5. Inani eliphezulu ngu-64, kodwa akufanele lidlule inani lama-CPU cores/imicu. Uma i-innodb_buffer_pool yakho ingaphansi kwe-1GB, kufanele usebenzise usayizi we-pool uhlukaniswe ngo-128MB. Qhubeka usebenzise le zibalo kuze kufike esilinganisweni esiphezulu senani lama-CPU cores noma u-64."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "%s will divide the innodb_buffer_pool into memory regions to improve performance for versions of MySQL upto and including MySQL 8.0.  The max value is 64, but should not exceed more than the number of CPU cores/threads.  When your innodb_buffer_pool is less than 1GB, you should use the pool size divided by 128MB.  Continue to use this equation up to the max of the number of CPU cores or 64."
msgstr "I-%s izohlukanisa i-innodb_buffer_pool ibe izigaba zenkumbulo ukuze ithuthukise ukusebenza ezinguqulweni ze-MySQL kuze kufike nakwi-MySQL 8.0. Inani eliphezulu ngu-64, kodwa akufanele lidlule inani lama-CPU cores/imicu. Uma i-innodb_buffer_pool yakho ingaphansi kwe-1GB, kufanele usebenzise usayizi we-pool uhlukaniswe ngo-128MB. Qhubeka usebenzise le zibalo kuze kufike esilinganisweni esiphezulu senani lama-CPU cores noma u-64."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "A minimum of %s m execution time"
msgstr "Okungenani isikhathi sokusebenza esingu-%s m"

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "A minimum of %s memory limit"
msgstr "Okungenani umkhawulo wenkumbulo ongu-%s"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "A valid timezone that matches MySQL and the system"
msgstr "Indawo yesikhathi evumelekile ehambisana ne-MySQL nesistimu"

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "As of %s %s, the you can control how often %s flushes transactions to disk.  The default is 1 second, but in high I/O systems setting to a value greater than 1 can allow disk I/O to be more sequential"
msgstr "Kusukela ku-%s %s, ungalawula ukuthi i-%s ikhipha kangaki okwenziwayo kudiski. Okuzenzakalelayo yisekhondi eli-1, kodwa ezinhlelweni ezine-I/O ephezulu ukusetha inani elingaphezu kuka-1 kungavumela i-I/O yediski ilandelane kakhudlwana"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Comments"
msgstr "Amazwana"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Current Value"
msgstr "Inani Lamanje"

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "Depending on the number of logins and use of spine data collector, %s will need many connections.  The calculation for spine is: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), then you must leave headroom for user connections, which will change depending on the number of concurrent login accounts."
msgstr "Kuye ngenani lokungena nokusetshenziswa komqoqi wedatha we-spine, i-%s izodinga ukuxhumana okuningi. Ukubala kwe-spine yilokhu: total_connections = total_processes * (total_threads + script_servers + 1), bese kufanele ushiye isikhala sokuxhumana kwabasebenzisi, okuzoshintsha kuye ngenani lama-akhawunti okungena kanyekanye."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "If using the Kadupul Performance Booster and choosing a memory storage engine, you have to be careful to flush your Performance Booster buffer before the system runs out of memory table space.  This is done two ways, first reducing the size of your output column to just the right size.  This column is in the tables poller_output, and poller_output_boost.  The second thing you can do is allocate more memory to memory tables.  We have arbitrarily chosen a recommended value of 10%% of system memory, but if you are using SSD disk drives, or have a smaller system, you may ignore this recommendation or choose a different storage engine.  You may see the expected consumption of the Performance Booster tables under Console -> System Utilities -> View Boost Status."
msgstr "Uma usebenzisa i-Kadupul Performance Booster futhi ukhetha injini yokugcina yememori, kufanele uqaphele ukusula ibhafa yakho ye-Performance Booster ngaphambi kokuba uhlelo luphelelwe yisikhala sethebula lememori. Lokhu kwenziwa ngezindlela ezimbili, okokuqala ukunciphisa usayizi wekholomu yakho yokukhipha ube kusayizi ofanele nje. Le kholomu ikumathebula i-poller_output, kanye ne-poller_output_boost. Into yesibili ongayenza wukwaba imemori eyengeziwe kumathebula ememori. Sikhethe ngokungahleliwe inani elinconyiwe elingu-10%% lememori yesistimu, kodwa uma usebenzisa ama-SSD disk drive, noma unohlelo oluncane, ungasinaki lesi siphakamiso noma ukhethe injini yokugcina ehlukile. Ungabona ukusetshenziswa okulindelwe kwamathebula e-Performance Booster ngaphansi kwe-Console -> System Utilities -> View Boost Status."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 200 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 100000 can be used."
msgstr "Uma unamadiski e-SSD, sebenzisa lesi siphakamiso. Uma unama-hard drive abonakalayo, sebenzisa i-200 * inani lama-drive asebenzayo kuhlu. Uma usebenzisa i-NVMe noma i-PCIe Flash, izinombolo ezinkulu kakhulu ezifika ku-100000 zingasetshenziswa."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion.  If you have physical hard drives, use 2000 * the number of active drives in the array.  If using NVMe or PCIe Flash, much larger numbers as high as 200000 can be used."
msgstr "Uma unamadiski e-SSD, sebenzisa lesi siphakamiso. Uma unama-hard drive abonakalayo, sebenzisa i-2000 * inani lama-drive asebenzayo kuhlu. Uma usebenzisa i-NVMe noma i-PCIe Flash, izinombolo ezinkulu kakhulu ezifika ku-200000 zingasetshenziswa."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If you have SSD disks, use this suggestion. Otherwise, do not set this setting."
msgstr "Uma unamadiski e-SSD, sebenzisa lesi siphakamiso. Uma kungenjalo, ungasethi lesi silungiselelo."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "If your tables have very large indexes, you must operate with the Barracuda innodb_file_format and the innodb_large_prefix equal to 1.  Failure to do this may result in plugins that can not properly create tables."
msgstr "Uma amathebula akho enezinkomba ezinkulu kakhulu, kufanele usebenze nge-Barracuda innodb_file_format kanye ne-innodb_large_prefix elingana no-1. Ukwehluleka ukwenza lokhu kungaholela kuma-plugin angakwazi ukudala amathebula kahle."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "InnoDB will hold as much tables and indexes in system memory as is possible.  Therefore, you should make the innodb_buffer_pool large enough to hold as much of the tables and index in memory.  Checking the size of the /var/lib/mysql/cacti directory will help in determining this value.  We are recommending 25%% of your systems total memory, but your requirements will vary depending on your systems size."
msgstr "I-InnoDB izogcina amathebula amaningi nezinkomba ememori yesistimu ngangokunokwenzeka. Ngakho-ke, kufanele wenze i-innodb_buffer_pool ibe nkulu ngokwanele ukubamba amathebula amaningi nezinkomba ememori. Ukuhlola usayizi wedayirekthri ye-/var/lib/mysql/cacti kuzosiza ekunqumeni leli nani. Sincoma ama-25%% ememori yonke yezinhlelo zakho, kodwa izidingo zakho zizohluka kuye ngosayizi wezinhlelo zakho."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "It is STRONGLY recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.5.3."
msgstr "Kunconywa KAKHULU ukuthi unike amandla i-InnoDB kunoma iyiphi inguqulo ye-%s engaphezu kwe-5.5.3."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "It is recommended that you enable InnoDB in any %s version greater than 5.1."
msgstr "Kunconywa ukuthi unike amandla i-InnoDB kunoma iyiphi inguqulo ye-%s engaphezu kwe-5.1."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Keeping the table cache larger means less file open/close operations when using innodb_file_per_table."
msgstr "Ukugcina i-table cache inkulu kusho imisebenzi embalwa yokuvula/yokuvala ifayela lapho usebenzisa i-innodb_file_per_table."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Maximum I/O performance happens when you use the O_DIRECT method to flush pages."
msgstr "Ukusebenza okukhulu kwe-I/O kwenzeka uma usebenzisa indlela ye-O_DIRECT ukukhipha amakhasi."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "MySQL 5.6+ and MariaDB 10.0+ are great releases, and are very good versions to choose. Make sure you run the very latest release though which fixes a long standing low level networking issue that was causing spine many issues with reliability."
msgstr "I-MySQL 5.6+ kanye ne-MariaDB 10.0+ ziyizikhululo ezinhle, futhi ziyizinguqulo ezinhle kakhulu ongazikhetha. Qinisekisa ukuthi usebenzisa inguqulo yakamuva kakhulu elungisa inkinga yakudala yenethiwekhi esezingeni eliphansi ebeyidala izinkinga eziningi zokuthembeka ku-spine."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Note: Many changes below require a database restart"
msgstr "Qaphela: Izinguquko eziningi ngezansi zidinga ukuqalwa kabusha kwedathabheyisi"

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "PHP %s is the minimum version"
msgstr "I-PHP %s yiyona nguqulo encane kunazo zonke"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Recommended Value"
msgstr "Inani Elinconyiwe"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Rogue queries should not for the database to go offline to others.  Kill these queries before they kill your system."
msgstr "Imibuzo eyingozi akufanele yenze idathabheyisi iphume ku-inthanethi kwabanye. Bulala le mibuzo ngaphambi kokuba ibulale isistimu yakho."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "Setting this value to 2 means that you will flush all transactions every second rather than at commit.  This allows %s to perform writing less often."
msgstr "Ukusetha leli nani ku-2 kusho ukuthi uzokhipha konke ukuthengiselana njalo ngomzuzwana kunokuba ngokuzibophezela.  Lokhu kuvumela u-%s ukuthi abhale kancane."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "This is where metadata is stored. If you had a lot of tables, it would be useful to increase this."
msgstr "Lapha yilapho igcinwa khona i-metadata. Uma ubenamathebula amaningi, kungaba usizo ukukhulisa lokhu."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "This settings should remain ON unless your Kadupul instances is running on either ZFS or FusionI/O which both have internal journaling to accommodate abrupt system crashes.  However, if you have very good power, and your systems rarely go down and you have backups, turning this setting to OFF can net you almost a 50% increase in database performance."
msgstr "Lesi silungiselelo kufanele sihlale SIVULIWE ngaphandle kwalapho isibonelo sakho se-Kadupul sisebenza ku-ZFS noma ku-FusionI/O zombili ezinokubhala kwangaphakathi ukubhekana nokuphahlazeka kwesistimu okungazelelwe.  Nokho, uma unamandla amahle kakhulu, futhi izinhlelo zakho zehla kancane futhi unamakhophi okusekela, ukucisha lesi silungiselelo kungakuzuzela ukwanda cishe okungu-50% ekusebenzeni kwesizindalwazi."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "Variable"
msgstr "Isiguquguquki"

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When executing subqueries, having a larger temporary table size, keep those temporary tables in memory."
msgstr "Lapho wenza imibuzo engaphansi, ukuba nosayizi omkhulu wethebula lesikhashana, gcina lawo mathebula esikhashana kumemori."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When performing joins, if they are below this size, they will be kept in memory and never written to a temporary file.  As this is a per connection memory allocation, care must be taken not to increase it too high.  The sum of the join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + Core MySQL/MariaDB memory should be below 80%.  If the recommendation is negative, you must decrease this and or the sort_buffer_size until the recommendation fits within the allowable memory."
msgstr "Lapho wenza ukujoyina, uma zingaphansi kwalolu sayizi, zizogcinwa kumemori futhi zingalokothi zibhalwe efayeleni lesikhashana.  Njengoba lokhu kuyisabelo sememori ngoxhumano ngalunye, kufanele kuqashelwe ukuthi kungakhushulwa kakhulu.  Isamba se-join_buffer_size + sort_buffer_size + read_buffer_size + read_rnd_buffer_size + thread_stack + binlog_cache_size + Core MySQL/MariaDB memory kufanele sibe ngaphansi kuka-80%.  Uma isincomo singesona esihle, kufanele wehlise lokhu kanye noma i-sort_buffer_size kuze kube yilapho isincomo singena ngaphakathi kwememori evumelekile."

#: lib/utility.php
#, php-format
msgid "When using InnoDB storage it is important to keep your table spaces separate.  This makes managing the tables simpler for long time users of %s.  If you are running with this currently off, you can migrate to the per file storage by enabling the feature, and then running an alter statement on all InnoDB tables."
msgstr "Lapho usebenzisa isitoreji se-InnoDB kubalulekile ukugcina izikhala zakho zamathebula zihlukene.  Lokhu kwenza ukuphatha amathebula kube lula kubasebenzisi besikhathi eside baka-%s.  Uma usebenza lokhu kuvaliwe okwamanje, ungathuthela kusitoreji ngefayela ngalinye ngokunika amandla isici, bese usebenzisa isitatimende se-alter kuwo wonke amathebula e-InnoDB."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using Kadupul with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4 character set as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Lapho usebenzisa i-Kadupul ngezilimi ezingesona isiNgisi, kubalulekile ukusebenzisa iqoqo lezinhlamvu le-utf8mb4 njengoba ezinye izinhlamvu zithatha ngaphezu kwebhayithi elilodwa."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using Kadupul with languages other than English, it is important to use the utf8mb4_unicode_ci collation type as some characters take more than a single byte."
msgstr "Lapho usebenzisa i-Kadupul ngezilimi ezingesona isiNgisi, kubalulekile ukusebenzisa uhlobo lokuhlanganisa lwe-utf8mb4_unicode_ci njengoba ezinye izinhlamvu zithatha ngaphezu kwebhayithi elilodwa."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using MariaDB 10.2.4 and above, this setting should be off if atomic writes are enabled.  Therefore, please enable atomic writes instead of the double write buffer as it will increase performance."
msgstr "Lapho usebenzisa i-MariaDB 10.2.4 nangaphezulu, lesi silungiselelo kufanele sivalwe uma ukubhala kwe-atomic kunikwe amandla.  Ngakho-ke, sicela unike amandla ukubhala kwe-atomic esikhundleni se-double write buffer njengoba kuzokwandisa ukusebenza."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using MariaDB 10.2.4 and above, you can use atomic writes over the doublewrite buffer to increase performance."
msgstr "Lapho usebenzisa i-MariaDB 10.2.4 nangaphezulu, ungasebenzisa ukubhala kwe-atomic phezu kwe-doublewrite buffer ukukhulisa ukusebenza."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "When using innodb_file_per_table, it is important to set the innodb_file_format to Barracuda.  This setting will allow longer indexes important for certain Kadupul tables."
msgstr "Lapho usebenzisa i-innodb_file_per_table, kubalulekile ukusetha i-innodb_file_format ku-Barracuda.  Lesi silungiselelo sizovumela izinkomba ezinde ezibalulekile kumathebula athile e-Kadupul."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With Remote polling capabilities, large amounts of data will be synced from the main server to the remote pollers.  Therefore, keep this value at or above 16M."
msgstr "Ngamakhono okuqoqa idatha Akude, inani elikhulu ledatha lizovumelaniswa kusuka kuseva eyinhloko kuya kuma-poller akude.  Ngakho-ke, gcina leli nani ku-16M noma ngaphezulu."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Ngesitoreji sesimanje sohlobo lwe-SSD, ukuba nemicu eminingi ye-io kunenzuzo ezinhlelweni ezinokusebenza okuphezulu kwe-io."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple read io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Ngesitoreji sesimanje sohlobo lwe-SSD, ukuba nemicu eminingi ye-io yokufunda kunenzuzo ezinhlelweni ezinokusebenza okuphezulu kwe-io."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple read io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Ngesitoreji sesimanje sohlobo lwe-SSD, ukuba nemicu eminingi ye-io yokufunda kunenzuzo ezinhlelweni ezinokusebenza okuphezulu kwe-io.  Kuye ngezinguqulo zakho ze-MariaDB/MySQL, leli nani lingafika ku-64.  Kodwa zama ukugcina inani lingaphansi kwemicu yakho ephelele ye-SMT kuseva yesizindalwazi."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple write io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics."
msgstr "Ngesitoreji sesimanje sohlobo lwe-SSD, ukuba nemicu eminingi ye-io yokubhala kunenzuzo ezinhlelweni ezinokusebenza okuphezulu kwe-io."

#: lib/utility.php
msgid "With modern SSD type storage, having multiple write io threads is advantageous for applications with high io characteristics.  Depending on your MariaDB/MySQL versions, this value can go as high as 64.  But try to keep the number less than your total SMT threads on the database server."
msgstr "Ngesitoreji sesimanje sohlobo lwe-SSD, ukuba nemicu eminingi ye-io yokubhala kunenzuzo ezinhlelweni ezinokusebenza okuphezulu kwe-io.  Kuye ngezinguqulo zakho ze-MariaDB/MySQL, leli nani lingafika ku-64.  Kodwa zama ukugcina inani lingaphansi kwemicu yakho ephelele ye-SMT kuseva yesizindalwazi."

