#: templates/platform/console_home_body.html.twig
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> None of the Core Kadupul Plugins, to date, have been re-designed to work with Remote Data Collectors.  Therefore, Plugins such as MacTrack, and HMIB, which require direct access to devices will not work with Remote Data Collectors at this time.  However, plugins such as Thold will work so long as the Remote Data Collector is in <b>'online'</b> mode."
msgstr "<strong>QAPHELA:</strong> Awekho ama-Core Kadupul Plugins, kuze kube manje, aklanyelwe kabusha ukusebenza nabaqoqi bedatha abakude (Remote Data Collectors). Ngakho-ke, ama-Plugins afana ne-MacTrack kanye ne-HMIB, adinga ukufinyelela okuqondile kumadivayisi, ngeke asebenze nabaqoqi bedatha abakude okwamanje. Nokho, ama-plugin afana ne-Thold azosebenza uma nje uMqoqi Wedatha Okude ekumodi ethi <b>'online'</b>."

#: templates/platform/console_home_body.html.twig
msgid "<strong>NOTE:</strong> You are logged into a Remote Data Collector.  When <b>'online'</b>, you will be able to view and control much of the Main Kadupul Web Site just as if you were logged into it.  Also, it's important to note that Remote Data Collectors are required to use the Kadupul's Performance Boosting Services <b>'On Demand Updating'</b> feature, and we always recommend using Spine.  When the Remote Data Collector is <b>'offline'</b>, the Remote Data Collectors Web Site will contain much less information.  However, it will cache all updates until the Main Kadupul Database and Web Server are reachable.  Then it will dump it's Boost table output back to the Main Kadupul Database for updating."
msgstr "<strong>QAPHELA:</strong> Ungene kuMqoqi Wedatha Okude (Remote Data Collector). Uma uku-<b>'online'</b>, uzokwazi ukubuka nokulawula ingxenye enkulu yeWebhusayithi Eyinhloko ye-Kadupul njengokungathi ungene kuyo. Futhi, kubalulekile ukuqaphela ukuthi Abaqoqi Bedatha Abakude bayadingeka ukuze basebenzise isici se-Kadupul's Performance Boosting Services esithi <b>'On Demand Updating'</b>, futhi sihlala sincoma ukusebenzisa i-Spine. Uma uMqoqi Wedatha Okude eku-<b>'offline'</b>, iWebhusayithi yoMqoqi Wedatha Okude izoqukatha ulwazi oluncane kakhulu. Nokho, izogcina zonke izibuyekezo ku-cache kuze kube yilapho Isizindalwazi Esiyinhloko se-Kadupul neSeva Yewebhu sekufinyeleleka. Bese izothulula umphumela wethebula layo le-Boost ubuyele kuSizindalwazi Esiyinhloko se-Kadupul ukuze kubuyekezwe."

