#: utilities.php
msgid "The Data Query Cache stores information gathered from Data Query input types. The values from these fields can be used in the text area of Graphs for Legends, Vertical Labels, and GPRINTS as well as in CDEF's."
msgstr "Inqolobane Yombuzo Wedatha igcina ulwazi oluqoqwe ezinhlotsheni zokufaka Zombuzo Wedatha. Amanani asuka kulezi zinkambu angasetshenziswa endaweni yombhalo Yamagrafu Yamalejendi, Amalebula Aqondile, nama-GPRINTS kanye nakuma-CDEF."

#: utilities.php
msgid "The Kadupul Log stores statistic, error and other message depending on system settings.  This information can be used to identify problems with the poller and application."
msgstr "Ilogi ye-Kadupul igcina izibalo, amaphutha neminye imilayezo kuye ngezilungiselelo zesistimu.  Lolu lwazi lungasetshenziswa ukukhomba izinkinga nge-poller nesofthiwe."

#: utilities.php
msgid "The Poller Cache will be re-generated if you select this option. Use this option only in the event of a database crash if you are experiencing issues after the crash and have already run the database repair tools.  Alternatively, if you are having problems with a specific Device, simply re-save that Device to rebuild its Poller Cache.  There is also a command line interface equivalent to this command that is recommended for large systems."
msgstr "Inqolobane Ye-Poller izokhiqizwa kabusha uma ukhetha le nketho. Sebenzisa le nketho kuphela uma kwenzeka ukuphahlazeka kwesizindalwazi uma uhlangabezana nezinkinga ngemva kokuphahlazeka futhi usuvele usebenzise amathuluzi okulungisa isizindalwazi.  Okunye, uma unezinkinga ngeDivayisi ethile, vele ulondoloze kabusha leyo Divayisi ukuze wakhe kabusha Inqolobane yayo Ye-Poller.  Kukhona futhi okulingana nomugqa womyalo kulo myalo okunconywayo kumasistimu amakhulu."

#: utilities.php
msgid "The SNMP cache will be cleared and re-generated if you select this option. Note that it takes another poller run to restore the SNMP cache completely."
msgstr "Inqolobane ye-SNMP izosulwa futhi ikhiqizwe kabusha uma ukhetha le nketho. Qaphela ukuthi kuthatha okunye ukusebenza kwe-poller ukuze kubuyiselwe inqolobane ye-SNMP ngokuphelele."

#: utilities.php
msgid "The minimum required can vary greatly if there is heavy user Graph viewing activity."
msgstr "Okuncane okudingekayo kungahluka kakhulu uma kunomsebenzi omkhulu wokubuka Igrafu womsebenzisi."

