msgstr "Lapho usebenzisa Abaqoqi Bedatha abaningi kwa-Kadupul, i-Kadupul izozama ukugcina isimo samafayela abalulekile kubo bonke Abaqoqi Bedatha.  Lokhu kuhlanganisa wonke amafayela ayisisekelo, angewona awokufaka ewebhusayithi kanye ne-plugin.  Uma uphoqa ukwakhiwa kabusha Kwenqolobane Yezinsiza, i-Kadupul izosula Inqolobane Yezinsiza yendawo, bese iyakha kabusha ekuqaleni okulandelayo okuhleliwe kwe-poller.  Lokhu kuzoqalisa bonke Abaqoqi Bedatha Abakude ukuthi bahlole kabusha amafayela abo ewebhusayithi ne-plugin ukuze ahambisane."

